C: Music: 'O Durchbrecher'  Johann Anastasius Freylinghausen,  1704. 
C: Setting: The Evangelical Lutheran Hymn Book, 1931.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: The Evangelical Lutheran Hymn Book, 1931. Hymn 182
S: Lyrics source: "The Holy Year" by Christopher Wordsworth, 1865.
